</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/bfa146d8-8656-11f1-b1ad-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/000-C2WK3WY.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/bfa146d8-8656-11f1-b1ad-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/000-C2WK3WY.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">f0dd364e-8656-11f1-9660-85dd569f696a</guid><pubDate>Thu, 23 Jul 2026 05:31:01 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/bfa146d8-8656-11f1-b1ad-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/000-C2WK3WY.jpg">AFP - ROMAIN PERROCHEAU</source><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>International</category><title>Germany approves factory use for controversial French-Russian nuclear project</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/international/20260723-germany-approves-factory-use-for-controversial-french-russian-nuclear-project</link><description>
